					<font size="2" style="font-size: 11pt"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><font size="2" style="font-size: 10pt"><span lang="en-GB">The
					Agent must endeavour to avoid any situation which involves, or
					may involve, a potential conflict of interest between their
					personal interests and the interests of the Principal. As in all
					other aspects of their duties, the Agent dealing with Potential
					Purchasers, or any person doing or seeking to do business with
					the Principal should always act in the best interests of the
					Principal.  </span></font></font></font>
					</p></li>
