					<font size="2" style="font-size: 11pt"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><font size="2" style="font-size: 10pt"><span lang="en-GB">The
					Agent shall make prompt and full disclosure in writing to the
					Principal of any situation which may involve a potential
					conflict of interest.  Such conflicts include, but are not
					limited to: </span></font></font></font>
					</p>
					<ol type="i">
						<li><p lang="ar-SA" align="justify" style="margin-right: 0.16in; margin-top: 0.09in; line-height: 147%">
						<font size="2" style="font-size: 11pt"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><font size="2" style="font-size: 10pt"><span lang="en-GB">having
						any direct or indirect personal financial interest in any of
						the Principal’s investments or projects,</span></font></font></font></p></li>
						<li><p lang="ar-SA" align="justify" style="margin-right: 0.16in; margin-top: 0.09in; line-height: 147%">
						<font size="2" style="font-size: 11pt"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><font size="2" style="font-size: 10pt"><span lang="en-GB">ownership
						by an Agent or by a member of an Agent’s family of a
						significant interest in any outside enterprise which does or
						seeks to do business with, or is a competitor of, the
						Principal, </span></font></font></font>
						</p></li>
						<li><p lang="ar-SA" align="justify" style="margin-right: 0.16in; margin-top: 0.09in; line-height: 147%">
						<font size="2" style="font-size: 11pt"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><font size="2" style="font-size: 10pt"><span lang="en-GB">acting
						as a broker, finder, go-between or otherwise for the benefit of
						oneself or a third party in transactions involving or
						potentially involving the Principal or its interests, </span></font></font></font>
						</p></li>
						<li><p lang="ar-SA" align="justify" style="margin-right: 0.16in; margin-top: 0.09in; line-height: 147%">
						<font size="2" style="font-size: 11pt"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><font size="2" style="font-size: 10pt"><span lang="en-GB">any
						other arrangements or circumstances, including via/indirectly
						through family or other personal relationships, which might
						dissuade an Agent from acting in the best interests of the
						Principal,</span></font></font></font></p></li>
						<li><p lang="ar-SA" align="justify" style="margin-right: 0.16in; margin-top: 0.09in; line-height: 147%">
